---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  A modal bottom sheet (the default <code>variant</code>) opens a native
  <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> in the browser’s top layer with a scrim. The page behind it is
  inert and doesn’t scroll, focus moves to the element with <code>autofocus</code> inside it, and
  returns to where it was when the sheet closes. Escape and a scrim click close it; set
  <code>no-light-dismiss</code> to keep it open on scrim clicks. Name the sheet with
  <code>label</code>.
</p>
<p>
  The drag handle is a button: drag it down, click it, or focus it and press Enter or Space to
  close the sheet. Set <code>hide-handle</code> to remove it.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-button id='show-modal-bottom'>Share</wc-button>

  <wc-bottom-sheet id='modal-bottom-sheet' label='Share'>
    <h3 style='margin: 0 0 0.5rem;'>Share “Atlas Website”</h3>
    <p>Drag the handle down, tap the scrim or press Escape to close.</p>
    <wc-button id='close-modal-bottom' variant='outlined' autofocus>Copy link</wc-button>
  </wc-bottom-sheet>

  <script is:inline>
    const modalBottomSheet = document.querySelector('#modal-bottom-sheet');
    document.querySelector('#show-modal-bottom').addEventListener('click', () => {
      modalBottomSheet.show();
    });
    document.querySelector('#close-modal-bottom').addEventListener('click', () => {
      modalBottomSheet.hide();
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Standard variant</h3>
<p>
  <code>variant="standard"</code> opens the sheet with <code>dialog.show()</code>: it isn’t
  modal, has no scrim and stays in the page flow at the end of its container. It doesn’t trap
  focus, lock scrolling or close on Escape.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-button id='show-standard-bottom' variant='outlined'>Toggle standard bottom sheet</wc-button>

  <div
    style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; height: 240px; margin-top: 1rem; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); border-radius: var(--shape-corner-medium);'
  >
    <p style='padding: 1rem; margin: 0;'>Page content</p>
    <wc-bottom-sheet id='standard-bottom-sheet' variant='standard' label='Now playing'>
      <h3 style='margin: 0 0 0.5rem;'>Now playing</h3>
      <p style='margin: 0;'>This sheet coexists with the page content.</p>
    </wc-bottom-sheet>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelector('#show-standard-bottom').addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelector('#standard-bottom-sheet').toggle();
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Events</h3>
<p>
  The sheet fires <code>open</code> when it opens and <code>close</code> when it closes, with
  <code>detail.reason</code>: <code>'escape'</code>, <code>'light-dismiss'</code> (a scrim
  click), <code>'action'</code> (the drag handle) or <code>'api'</code> (<code>hide()</code>).
</p>
